flowchart TB
  accTitle: Troubleshoot proxy connections by symptom
  accDescr: Check four symptoms: a refused connection, different ping and curl results, application failures, and slow internal services. Inspect the proxy port, firewall, proxy variables, and no_proxy. ICMP ping does not validate an HTTP proxy.

subgraph network["Connection and protocol"]
    direction TB
    refused["curl reports Connection refused"]
    port["Check that the proxy port is open<br/>Check whether the firewall blocks it"]
    retest["Retry curl after correcting the issue"]
    ping["Ping works but curl does not"]
    protocol["Ping uses ICMP<br/>It does not use the HTTP proxy"]
    verbose["Inspect connection details<br/>curl -v https://www.google.com"]
    refused --> port --> retest
    retest ~~~ ping
    ping --> protocol --> verbose
  end
  subgraph applications["Applications and internal access"]
    direction TB
    app["pip or git still cannot connect"]
    variables["Check that http_proxy and https_proxy<br/>are both set"]
    git["Optional Git-specific proxy setting<br/>git config --global http.proxy $http_proxy"]
    slow["Internal services become slow"]
    bypass["Check whether no_proxy<br/>includes the internal destination"]
    direct["Complete the internal bypass list<br/>Then test the internal service again"]
    app --> variables --> git
    git ~~~ slow
    slow --> bypass --> direct
  end
